<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</text><view class="title">阅读与服务设置</view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">外观</text></view><view class="segmented"><button class="{{selectedTheme === 'system' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-theme="system" bindtap="onTheme">跟随系统</button><button class="{{selectedTheme === 'light' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-theme="light" bindtap="onTheme">浅色</button><button class="{{selectedTheme === 'dark' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-theme="dark" bindtap="onTheme">深色</button></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">释义字号</text></view><view class="segmented"><button class="{{fontSize === 14 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-size="14" bindtap="onSize">小</button><button class="{{fontSize === 16 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-size="16" bindtap="onSize">标准</button><button class="{{fontSize === 18 ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-size="18" bindtap="onSize">大</button></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">离线词库</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="onDictionaries">管理牛津词库</button></view><view class="small muted">已导入牛津包后，查词、音标、双语例句和中文反查可完全离线使用。内置另有 {{offlineCount}} 个开源或原创示例。</view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">配套服务</text><switch color="#267fbb" checked="{{online}}" bindchange="onOnline"/></view><view class="small muted">朗读、识图、语音转写及尚未配置的 AI 服务使用以下地址。用户笔记和复习进度不会自动上传。</view><input class="field address" value="{{apiBase}}" placeholder="http://本机或局域网地址:18748" bindinput="onAddress"/><button class="primary" loading="{{checking}}" disabled="{{checking}}" bindtap="onConnect">保存并检查连接</button><view wx:if="{{statusText}}" class="info">{{statusText}}</view><view wx:if="{{serviceRows.length}}" class="card service-list"><view wx:for="{{serviceRows}}" wx:key="name" class="service-row"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="small {{item.available ? 'available' : 'muted'}}">{{item.available ? '可用' : '待配置'}}</text></view><view class="small muted">{{item.detail}}</view></view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">本地数据</text></view><view class="card about"><button class="text-button" bindtap="onBackup">完整学习备份与恢复</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="onClearCache">仅清理查词缓存</button><view>账号、支付、广告和推送维持移除。只有主动拍照、录音、选择或分享文件时，才使用相应微信能力。</view><view>牛津内容不在公开仓库中分发，原词库未附原版录音与插图。朗读使用服务端实际安装的音色。</view><view>本机数据可能因清理微信数据、删除小程序或存储故障而丢失，请主动导出学习备份。</view></view></view>
